**Verdict: CONCERNS / LEGIT**

The clean two-claim proof reconstructs successfully with `#Top`, pins the exact translated program, covers every integer `n > 0`, and rejects meaningful false mutations. Concerns are limited to claim dependency coupling and unreachable limitations in the broader supplied semantics.

